XLuffa - a full screen game
X
XThe game is played on a grid, and the object of the game is to
Xget five of your marks (X'es or O's) in a row. A special rule
Xsays that you may not place your second mark within two squares
Xof the first mark if you begin the game, to even out the odds.
X
XLuffa accepts most terminals that curses know of.
XLuffa accepts the following options:
X -g   Play on a grid
X -o   Play O's
X -e   Use ! in grid
X -c   Let computer begin
X -h   toggle hilite mode
X -x   Play X's (this is default)
X -b   Use | for grids (this is default)
X
XLuffa accepts the following input:
X h,H,4	Move cursor left
X l,L,6	Move cursor right
X j,J,2	Move cursor down
X k,K,8	Move cursor up
X SPACE	Place mark
X ^L,^R	Redraw screen
X !, ^Z	Shell escape
X ^C	Quit
X S	Save game
X
XLuffa was written by Jon W{tte at kth (h+@nada.kth.se) 890414-15
